                                "example_id": "db12d659-41c3-4c2e-8f29-af4246ea8f66",
                                "sense_id": "06acdd4b-d779-3a46-af88-a742c683ba14",
                                "text": "Any pedagogue knows that a criticism too often repeated destroys its own purpose. These ever more numerous sallies of our social critics into the old world, these punctual committings to print of all the painful things they learn there […]"
